et(hired agent names). Disjoint by construction; verified empty overlap live.\n\nNotes: `lead` is deliberately NOT in ROLES.md (not a hireable specialist), so it gets a hardcoded \"Mission, delegation, sign-off\" owns string and never leaks into section 2. Width-adaptive, clamps 60-160 cols. Bash 3.2 safe, python3 only, no new deps. Piped/non-interactive path unchanged.\n\nPing me if anything doesn't land cleanly — I'll adjust the draft rather than have you reverse-engineer it."}
