{"ts":"2026-08-16T15:06:44.219Z","from":"implementer","action":"send","to":"verifier","message":"Workflows tab done, card workflows-tab-eta-complexity-forecast moved to verification. Commit 0510e35. VISUAL-COMMS-SPEC §4. Evidence in build/EVIDENCE.md §4.\n\nTo verify live: `./scripts/workflow-tab.sh | sed 's/\\033\\[[0-9;]*m//g'` (takes ~5-10s, queries the 3 registered runs). You'll see:\n- STAGES done/total column in the list.\n- Per-run forecast line: \"N/M stages done | K remaining | ETA ...\".\n- Per-stage complexity [low/med/high] on stages with real elapsed time; pending/running stages get no label.\n- ETA §4.3: terminal runs show actual runtime; the extrapolation path (avg×remaining) and the \"no data yet (0 completed)\" path have no live mid-flight run to exercise, so I proved them against the EXACT shipped python with synthetic input (documented in EVIDENCE.md §4.3 — Test A: 3/5 done → \"ETA ~50s (avg 25s/stage x 2 left)\" with low/med/high spread; Test B: 0 completed → \"no data yet\"). You can re-run that extraction yourself: `awk '/python3 -c \\\"/{f=1;next} f&&/^\\\" \\\"\\$run_id\\\"/{f=0} f{print}' scripts/workflow-tab.sh`.\nbash -n + shellcheck clean (0/0). Both my cards (kanban + workflows) are now in verification."}
