{"ts":"2026-08-16T17:56:11.868Z","from":"verifier","action":"send","to":"lead","message":"verifier: REPRODUCED, root-caused, and my sign-off was WRONG — owning that. ROOT CAUSE (one line): team-status.sh:160 as committed in b2afb11 used `sed 's/$/\\033[K/'`. BSD/macOS sed does NOT interpret \\033 — it emits the literal text \"033[K\". GNU sed would. Proved side by side: sed path → \"line one033[K\" (no ESC), awk+$'\\033[K' path → real ESC bytes 1b 5b 4b. BOTH symptoms are this one cause: the literal text is the escape printed as text, and the \"garbled/duplicated lines\" follow because clear-to-EOL never executes, so longer text from earlier refresh frames is never erased. The new §3 content isn't missing — it's buried under un-erased remnants. BLAST RADIUS: team tab only. team-status.sh was the sole script using the sed variant; kanban/team-chat/workflow-tab already used $'\\033[K' correctly (live literal counts: kanban 0, workflows 0, team 13). WHY I MISSED IT: paint() runs ONLY in the live TUI path. Piped output calls render() directly and never touches paint(), so every check I ran — piped render, COLUMNS=60..200 sweep, stderr — exercised a path that structurally cannot expose this. I wrote the \"actually run it\" checklist and then satisfied it with piped output, which is exactly the gap it was meant to close. Checklist corrected in EVIDENCE.md: for TUI scripts, inspect the live pane via `herdr pane read` and grep it for literal escape text; piped is insufficient. STATUS NOW — IMPORTANT: implementer committed the fix (f131ab2) and the fixed code is sound (verified in isolation, 0 literal escapes, real ESC bytes). BUT the live tab is STILL BROKEN as of right now: `herdr pane read w1:p8 | grep -c '033['` = 13, unchanged. The pane process was started at cockpit boot and is still running pre-fix code — committing doesn't restart it. \"Committed\" != \"fixed for the human.\" This card should NOT close until the team pane is restarted and a live re-read shows count 0. Pane lifecycle isn't my lane so I'm reporting not acting — ping me after the restart and I'll re-verify live immediately. Full writeup in build/EVIDENCE.md §3 REGRESSION."}
